  "notes": "An older form of ⟦{転|てん}じる→転じる：31145_tenjiru⟧ with the same meaning; both are formal, written words. They conjugate alike, with a じ stem: {転|てん}じた, {転|てん}じて, {転|てん}じない.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{転|てん}ずる: to turn into ~, to switch to ~\n- {攻勢|こうせい}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{転|てん}ずる: to go on the offensive\n- ⟦{話題|わだい}→話題：03793_wadai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{転|てん}ずる: to change the subject\n- ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{転|てん}ずる: to turn one's attention elsewhere\n- {禍|わざわい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{転|てん}じて{福|ふく}⟦と→と：00512_to⟧なす: to turn misfortune into a blessing\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive with ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{転|てん}ずる \"to turn to ~\") and transitive with ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ (〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{転|てん}ずる \"to shift ~\").",
